<title>UK: LME tracks back, copper slides to near $2,370.</title>
<headline>LME tracks back, copper slides to near $2,370.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Tailing lower, with spread slightly softer at $135/140 backwardation. Neves Corvo strike being offset by rising stocks.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Falls back also. NICKEL - Turns lower.</p>
<p>LEAD - Drifts under $650. ZINC - Holds steady.</p>
<p>TIN - Quiet in  tight range. ALLOY - Neglected.</p>
</text>
